CORE
main.cpp
--cpp11 --stdlib libc++
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ zero indices: SUCCESS$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
--
The --stdlib libc++ flag engages the CLANG-preprocessor-gated
member-alias enclosing pre-bind (the file itself is header-free).
Counterfactually verified: without the fix main is dropped
(0 properties, "could not fully type-check" warning).
